{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is close, take it, move if heavy, if not visible approach, scan. Finally perform specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedLocation    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
